<section id="A3.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.2. </span>Mapping for Presidio</h3>

<div id="A3.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The classification follows the logic that direct identifiers and sensitive attributes related to individuals fall under personal, while business-related and general references are non-personal unless they reveal individual identity. This table provides an overview of the PII entities that Presidio can detect using its predefined recognizers.</p>
</div>
